  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jamajigi Seed and Cereal Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Cereal production and marketing (millet, sorghum, cowpeas) Beneficiaries: 2,933 (812 women) Activities: Capacity building, particularly organizational and financial management, including formalization of administrative and financial manuals, systems, and archives, and investment in access to production inputs and improved marketing facilities.</narrative>
  </description>
